      "text": "[7:03PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nImproved movement from UBA Roundabout towards NNPC Filling Station, with a smooth flow of traffic inward journey from Cathedral Church to Nitel Intersection.\nGood traffic flow along State House frontage, inward to McWen, connecting to Force Road.\nEfficient movement from Zone 2 Underneath the Bridge towards Flagstaff House, inward to McWen Bridge, and en route to Bonny Camp.\nFavorable traffic conditions from Onikan Roundabout towards TBS, inward to Water Board, and connecting to Nitel Intersection, with the entire stretch of Broad Street experiencing good movement.\nSmooth traffic flow from General Hospital towards Tinubu Square, connecting to Abibu Oki Street by Martins Junction, although approaching Davies Street, the inward journey from Apongbon is experiencing slow and steady movement due to commercial activities.\nFaster movement on Igbosere Road and Catholic Mission Street, connecting to Ganiu Smith Street.\n\nTraffic Officers are actively on ground to monitor the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
