      "text": "[7:58PM] #Ikoyi #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow on both inward and outward Awolowo Road, extending down to Onikan Roundabout.\nBusy traffic at Falomo inward Boudillion Road, attributed to a large crowd gathered at President's House, resulting in slow movement on Boudillion Road.\nGood traffic conditions on Alfred Rewane Road, Registry, NNPC, inward to Golden Gate, intersecting with Bayo Kuku.\nEfficient movement from Bayo Kuku inward to Osborne Foreshore, Dolphin Bridge, connecting to Ilubirin, and inward to 3rd Mainland Bridge.\n\nOfficers are actively on ground to ensure a smooth flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
